# Weft — private ops playbook template

Copy to `OPS.local.md` (gitignored) and fill in your hosts.

```bash
cp OPS.local.md.example OPS.local.md
```

## Host map

| SSH alias | Role | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| *(EVM edge)* | Weft status API / daemon | Tight disk — no second Canton stack |
| *(Canton build)* | dpm 3.4.x, DAR builds, `weft_canton_api` | Prefer the VPS with headroom |
| *(laptop)* | Git + UI only | Clear local `~/.daml` / `~/.dpm` after remote build works |

## Ports

| Port | Service |
|---|---|
| 9010 | EVM `weft_status_api` |
| 9020 | Canton `weft_canton_api` |

## Pointers

- Canton public docs: `canton/DEVNET_RUNBOOK.md`, `canton/DEMO.md`
- Ledger mirror (gitignored): `canton/.ledger/`
- Unit file: `canton/scripts/weft-canton-api.service`
